# Source of truth for the demo script.
# Run: python scenes.py  -> writes scenes.json, scenes-captions.json
# "voiceover" is the text sent to text-to-speech (written the way it is spoken).
# "caption" is the same text spelled the way it appears on screen (used for captions).
